{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/fe508696ba3a5ce40e9f731ce94cef6b.poster.avif?t=1769088616\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/fe508696ba3a5ce40e9f731ce94cef6b.webm?t=1769088616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 firearms and 6 melee weapons. A dynamic status effect system encourages creative weapon combinations and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gritty world where danger lurks in every shadow, and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of human nature in a decaying world. Your wayward brother wants a ride to retrieve an old stash \u2014 what could possibly go wrong?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583670?t=1769088616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583670?t=1769088616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/8e0e68583b18935adb6e5fc3717f24986e546f87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769088616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/8e0e68583b18935adb6e5fc3717f24986e546f87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769088616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3743000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven, top-down horror shooter set in a zombie-infested post-apocalypse. Visceral, grounded, and realistic. A fresh take on a classic genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/fe508696ba3a5ce40e9f731ce94cef6b.poster.avif?t=1769088616\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/extras/fe508696ba3a5ce40e9f731ce94cef6b.webm?t=1769088616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Combat System </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tactical, skill-based combat with a wide range of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy Variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 8 distinct types of zombies with unique behaviors, as well as organized, well-equipped bandits. If you're clever, you can even pit them against each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 12 firearms and 6 melee weapons. A dynamic status effect system encourages creative weapon combinations and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gritty world where danger lurks in every shadow, and every shot counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of human nature in a decaying world. Your wayward brother wants a ride to retrieve an old stash \u2014 what could possibly go wrong?</p>","developers":["MonkeyBassGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583670/3a280747ba6787c27819c5d0a89d30b588ae6ad5/header.jpg?t=1769088616","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583670/801917858/0fb1e974dad86c3953bf8e730616193fecc354d0/1759141228/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759314263","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583670/801917858/0fb1e974dad86c3953bf8e730616193fecc354d0/1759141228/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759314263","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3583670/801917858/0fb1e974dad86c3953bf8e730616193fecc354d0/1759141228/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759314263","id":257208473,"name":"Demo update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208473/0603bf68321fa429554dde9dd70273ac91a47dd1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759314263"}],"name":"Where the forest ends","package_groups":[]